      "message": "Not true, see how LIS2MDL_ST_DATA is used. drv_data is already set using this macro.\n\nin lis2mdl_private_data, you most likely need to specifiy struct stprivate_data data; as the first field, so that it is the first field either standalone or behind an IMU.",
