      },
      "lineNbr": 69,
      "author": {
        "id": 1259838
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-05-14T17:08:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can\u0027t defined the stprivate_data field first since the mag_cal_t already needs to be defined first (\"lsm6dsm_data union requires cal be first element\").\n\nI think we need to keep the forked defined in the header file for LIS2MDL_ST_DATA at least",
      "parentUuid": "502ecc4d_fe8125d1",
      "revId": "f023a70df2f2899df0e140aa1d72d42174df14b7",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
