    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "80b4dcc4_d841b669",
        "filename": "driver/mag_lis2mdl.c",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 69,
      "author": {
        "id": 1333748
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-05-14T18:19:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a much deeper issue where our drivers have dependencies between them. For now I don\u0027t see another way around this. We define LIS2MDL_ST_DATA in the header and it has to be aware of whether or not the sensor is behind the fifo or not in order to find the stprivate_data for the magnetometer in the drv_data.",
      "parentUuid": "e904779d_7c165e68",
      "revId": "f023a70df2f2899df0e140aa1d72d42174df14b7",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d70b4d91_6a43a48e",
        "filename": "driver/mag_lis2mdl.c",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 69,
      "author": {
        "id": 1104704
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-05-15T05:21:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is not the right change, all ST sensors have -\u003edrv_data pointing to stprivate_data.\n\nWhat we can do is for standalone driver.\n\n +--- lis2mdl_private_data ---+ \u003c--\\      LIS2MDL_CAL(s)\n |                            |    |\n | struct mag_cal_t cal;      |    |\n |                            |    |\n | struct stprivate_data data;| \u003c-------- drv_data\n |  ...                       |           [ LIS2MDL_ST_DATA(lis2mdl_a_data), used in board.c]\n +----------------------------+",
      "parentUuid": "80b4dcc4_d841b669",
      "revId": "f023a70df2f2899df0e140aa1d72d42174df14b7",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
